MARIAN (ILUSTRADO) attribution
================================

The optional speaker-training crumbs under data/marian_crumbs/ are
duration-capped slices extracted from MARIAN (ILUSTRADO), an English
ARPAsing OpenUtau voicebank.

Voicebank name: MARIAN (ILUSTRADO)
Voice provider / author: Kanabun
Official download: https://downloadmarian.carrd.co/
(ILUSTRADO Series — MediaFire: MARIAN_ILUSTRADO_Series.zip)

Terms of use require attributing the voicebank name exactly as MARIAN
when publishing work that uses it. See Kanabun's terms on the download
page. This repository redistributes only short, capped phoneme crumbs
used to fit parametric speaker flies — not the full voicebank.

Do not use these crumbs with AI-generated artwork (author prohibition).
